<p align="left"><strong>Share Repurchase Program</strong></p>

<p align="justify">On June 10, 2026, the Company announced that its Board of Directors had authorized a share repurchase program under
which the Company may repurchase up to US$15 million of its ordinary shares in the form of American depositary shares over a 12-month
period, expiring on June 14, 2027. As of August 31, 2026, the Company had repurchased approximately 114,000 ADSs for a total consideration
of approximately US$1.6 million.</p>

